# 🚀 Day 28 – Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 28 focused on building an **Interactive Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator** using **Claude AI**. This project simulates the role of a **Hospital Admission Coordinator**, helping users evaluate whether a patient is ready for hospital admission based on clinical, administrative, and insurance requirements.

The simulator demonstrates how healthcare teams coordinate admission workflows while tracking risks, documentation, insurance verification, and Prior Authorization (PA) status.

---

# 🏥 Project Description

**Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator**

A healthcare workflow application that guides users through the hospital admission process by evaluating patient readiness using industry-inspired criteria and interactive workflow actions.

The simulator provides educational insights into admission management while calculating a dynamic readiness score.

